flowchart TD
A([Document status = present]) --> P1{Usable comparison key?}
P1 -->|no| M[lifecycle: missing<br/>never guess]
P1 -->|yes| P2{Which rule governs now?}
P2 -->|none yet| PU[unchanged<br/>becomes governing]
P2 -->|same key| PU2[unchanged]
P2 -->|different key| PM[amended<br/>earlier unchanged superseded<br/>becomes governing]
P2 -->|'no such provision'| PA[amended<br/>provision added<br/>earlier N/A superseded]
